0..77 Comment "// Exits: `return` and `become` end a computation, each beside an elided twin"
78..109 Comment "// that leaves the keyword out."
110..112 Comment "//"
113..188 Comment "// An elided exit is the same exit as the written one, so each pair checks,"
189..268 Comment "// runs or is refused alike. A dropped value, and an exit bound as a value, are"
269..280 Comment "// refused."
281..283 Comment "//"
284..363 Comment "// The checker reads a body\'s last expression as its exit. It refuses a dropped"
364..433 Comment "// natural `ShapeMismatch`, and an exit bound by `let` `Unreachable`."
434..436 Comment "//"
437..468 Comment "// - see: #1205 — `discarded`"
